yle=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove/Collectables#Doubloons\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove/Collectables\">Copper Doubloon</a></b></span></span><b>400</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Silver_Doubloon.png/25px-Silver_Doubloon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Silver_Doubloon.png 1.5x\" /></span></span> <span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove/Collectables#Doubloons\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove/Collectables\">Silver Doubloon</a></b></span></span><b>25</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Stolen_Amethyst.png/25px-Stolen_Amethyst.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Stolen_Amethyst.png 1.5x\" /></span></span> <span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove/Collectables#Stolen_Gems\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove/Collectables\">Stolen Amethyst</a></b></span></span> at <a href=\"/page/Dusty_Old_Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Dusty Old Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Dusty Old Treasure of Crystal Cove</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_-_Tier_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable - Tier 1\">Upgradeable - Tier 1</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+3 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+3 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +3 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Intimidate\" title=\"Intimidate\">Intimidate +11</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Intimidate\" title=\"Intimidate\">Intimidate +11</a>:</b> Passive: +11 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Intimidate\" title=\"Intimidate\">Intimidate</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Alignment_damage_(weapon)#Anarchic\" title=\"Alignment damage (weapon)\">Anarchic</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Alignment_damage_(weapon)#Anarchic\" title=\"Alignment damage (weapon)\">Anarchic</a>:</b> An anarchic weapon is chaotically aligned and infused with the power of chaos. It makes the weapon chaos-aligned and thus bypasses the corresponding damage reduction. It deals an extra 2 to 12 damage against all of <a href=\"/page/Lawful\" title=\"Lawful\">lawful</a> alignment.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mortal_Strike\" title=\"Mortal Strike\">Mortal Strike</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mortal_Strike\" title=\"Mortal Strike\">Mortal Strike</a>:</b> On an attack roll of 20 which is confirmed as a critical hit this weapon triggers the <a href=\"/page/Slay_Living\" title=\"Slay Living\">Slay Living</a> spell and attempts to instantly snuff out the life force of the enemy (DC 17).</span></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_-_Tier_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable - Tier 2\">Upgradeable - Tier 2</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+3 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+3 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +3 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span> &#8594; <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+4 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+4 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +4 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_-_Tier_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable - Tier 3\">Upgradeable - Tier 3</a>\n<ul><li>Adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/True_Chaos\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"True Chaos\">True Chaos</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/True_Chaos\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"True Chaos\">True Chaos</a>:</b> This weapon is infused with the power of True Chaos. It does an additional 1 to 6 damage to non-chaotic targets and can only be wielded by Chaotic-aligned characters.</span></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Brigand%27s_Cutlass_(Level_12).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Brigand%27s_Cutlass_%28Level_12%29.png/420px-Brigand%27s_Cutlass_%28Level_12%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"562\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Brigand%27s_Cutlass_%28Level_12%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Treasure of Crystal Cove</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>A curved sword with an elegant hilt. popular amongst pirates for its intimidating and yet sophisticated appearance. This particular blade is infused with the rowdiness and anarchy of a high-seas brigand, and is impeccably useful against lawful opponents.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/page/Item:Brigand%27s_Cutlass\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Item:Brigand&#39;s Cutlass\">Brigand's Cutlass</a> - Full table of the Brigand's Cutlass line <br />\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>50</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Stolen_Amethyst.png/25px-Stolen_Amethyst.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Stolen_Amethyst.png 1.5x\" /></span></span> <span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove/Collectables#Stolen_Gems\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove/Collectables\">Stolen Amethyst</a></b></span></span><b